==Strategy==
==='''Chapter 1 & Chapter 2'''===
Use [[Valkyrie Cat (Special Cat)|True Valkyrie Cat]] or [[Bahamut Cat (Special Cat)|Crazed Bahamut Cat]] as your main attacker while backing them up with [[Lizard Cat (Normal Cat)|Dragon Cats]], meatshields and tanky units like [[Titan Cat (Normal Cat)|Mythical Titan Cat]] or [[Fish Cat (Normal Cat)|Whale Cat]].

=== '''Chapter 3''' ===
Any cat that counters [[:Category:Angel Enemies|Angels]] (such as [[Rocker Cat (Rare Cat)|Rocker Cat]]) will help here. Don't forget to add any [[:Category:Anti-Alien Cats|anti-alien]] cats in your lineup!

